{"id":"5080","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5080_main_lightning-cloud-discharge-anvil-zits_clouds-electrometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张照片显示的是在美国德克萨斯州Decatur附近的一场严重雷暴的砧状云中有许多小的闪电放电，非正式地称为“砧状痘”（见<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>处）。照片曝光时间为15秒，因此捕捉到了了许多闪电放电的例子。在砧状云中也能明显地看到特征不那么鲜明的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">乳房状云</span>。雷暴产生了5厘米直径的冰雹。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"美国德克萨斯州博伊德","latitude":"纬度: 33° 5' 40'' N","longitude":"经度: 97° 38' 47'' W","date":"26 May 2009 2130 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.14.1.1.2"}]}]}